<Positioned left="32" top="18" width="1000" height="46"><Text fontSize="34" color="#0F172A" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC">转化变化，为什么不能只看平均？</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="32" top="64" width="1200" height="30"><Text fontSize="20" color="#64748B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">两个渠道的转化率都上升，总体转化率却下降 —— 分组与总体不同向。数据源 inputs/conversion.csv（4 行，原样使用）</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="1008" top="30" width="560" height="26"><Text fontSize="19" color="#64748B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="RIGHT">单位：访问数 = 次；成交数 = 笔；转化率 = 成交 ÷ 访问</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="32" top="104" width="520" height="410"><Container width="520" height="410" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #E2E8F0"/></Positioned><Positioned left="52" top="120" width="400" height="30"><Text fontSize="23" color="#0F172A" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC">① 各渠道分组转化率</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="52" top="154" width="460" height="24"><Text fontSize="18" color="#64748B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">两渠道各自 ↑ 上升 · 纵轴统一 0–100%</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="32" top="120" width="500" height="26"><Row mainAxisAlignment="END" crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Container width="13" height="13" color="#2563EB" borderRadius="3"/><SizedBox width="7" /><Text fontSize="18" color="#334155" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">直接访问</Text></Row><SizedBox width="22" /><Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Container width="13" height="13" color="#EA8C00" borderRadius="3"/><SizedBox width="7" /><Text fontSize="18" color="#334155" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">推广访问</Text></Row></Row></Row></Positioned><Positioned left="106" top="381.2" width="374" height="1.6"><Container width="374" height="1.6" color="#CBD5E1"/></Positioned><Positioned left="52" top="371.0" width="42" height="24"><Text fontSize="18" color="#94A3B8" fontFamily="Inter Medium,Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="RIGHT">0%</Text></Positioned><Positioned left