50" top="830" width="594" height="42"><Container width="594" height="42" color="#CCFBF1"/></Positioned><Positioned left="60" top="838.0" width="44" height="30"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F766E" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT">后期</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="104" top="838.0" width="84" height="30"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F766E" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="LEFT">总体</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="188" top="838.0" width="110" height="30"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F766E" fontFamily="Inter Medium,Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="RIGHT">10,000</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="298" top="838.0" width="110" height="30"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F766E" fontFamily="Inter Medium,Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="RIGHT">1,660</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="408" top="838.0" width="140" height="30"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F766E" fontFamily="Inter Medium,Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="CENTER">1660/10000</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="548" top="838.0" width="86" height="30"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F766E" fontFamily="Inter Medium,Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="RIGHT">16.60%</Text></Positioned></Stack></Container><Positioned left="50" top="890" width="594"><Text fontSize="18" color="#64748B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" height="1.42" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">总体行＝总成交 ÷ 总访问；渠道行＝各自分组率，两者不可互换。所有分数均由 CSV 原始分子分母现算。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="678" top="526" width="890" height="440"><Container width="890" height="440" color="#F8FAFC" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #E2E8F0"/></Positioned><Positioned left="698" top="540" width="400" height="30"><Text fontSize="23" color="#0F172A" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC">主结论与限制</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="698" top="580" width="4" height="122.36000000000001"><Container width="4" height="122.36000000000001" color="#0F766E" borderRadius="2"/></Positioned><Positioned left="712" top="578" width="844" height="30"><Text fontSize="22" color="#0F766E" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC">主结论</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="712" top="610" width="844"><Text fontSize="22" color="#1E293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" height="1.46" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">两个渠道的分组转化率都在上升（直接访问 30.00% → 35.00%，推广访问 10.00% → 12.00%），但总体转化率从 26.00% 降到 16.60%，相差 -9.40 个百分点。原因是访问构成完全翻转：转化率更高的直接访问占比从 80.00% 降到 20.00%。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="698" top="722.36" width="4" height="90.24"><Container width="4" height="90.24" color="#B45309" borderRadius="2"/></Positioned><Positioned left="712" top="720.36" width="844" height="30"><Text fontSize="22" color="#B45309" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC">限制：不能由该数据证明因果</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="712" top="752.36" width="844"><Text fontSize="22" color="#1E293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" height="1.46" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">只能说明「构成变化足以造成总体下降」这一算术关系，不能证明因果。数据中没有渠道定义、投放、落地页版本与实验分组，无法判定构成变化的原因与持续性。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="698" top="832.6" width="4" height="90.24"><Container width="4" height="90.24" color="#334155" borderRadius="2"/></Positioned><Positioned left="712" top="830.6" width="844" height="30"><Text fontSize="22" color="#334155" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC">口径对照</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="712" top="862.6" width="844"><Text fontSize="22" color="#1E293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" height="1.46" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true">总体 = 1,660 ÷ 10,000 = 16.60%；错误做法 (35.00% + 12.00%) ÷ 2 = 23.50%，方向相反。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="32" top="950" width="1536" height="1"><Positioned left="0" top="0" width="1536" height="1"><Container width="1536" height="1" color="#CBD5E1"/></Positioned></Positioned><Positioned left="32" top="960" width="1536" height="26"><Text fontSize="19" color="#64748B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">数据源 inputs/conversion.csv（4 行：2 期 × 2 渠道）· 所有比率均由原始分子分母现算，未使用任何预先平均的比例 · 详细分数与公式见 analysis.json</Text></Positioned>
</Stack>
